WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.818
Every station has its own page.

00:00:02.938 --> 00:00:10.186
After this video you can read it, add a photo, print
its QR code, edit the details, and delete a station.

00:00:11.017 --> 00:00:15.553
To find a station's page, start on My stations
and click its row.

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:18.255
A pop-up opens.

00:00:18.375 --> 00:00:22.191
Click Open full page to see everything about
the station.

00:00:23.017 --> 00:00:25.153
This is the station page.

00:00:25.273 --> 00:00:30.217
The name is at the top, with a link back to My
stations and the kind of station.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:34.698
Show on map takes you to this station's pin on
the map.

00:00:35.517 --> 00:00:39.189
Data history lists the measurements saved at
this station.

00:00:39.309 --> 00:00:41.397
We will visit it soon.

00:00:42.217 --> 00:00:45.001
Edit changes the station's details.

00:00:45.121 --> 00:00:48.673
You only see Edit on stations that you look
after.

00:00:49.483 --> 00:00:52.987
Delete, in red, switches a station off.

00:00:53.107 --> 00:00:57.331
On someone else's station, you see Request
data instead.

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:00.262
This note is a reminder.

00:01:00.382 --> 00:01:02.926
Nobody has checked these measurements.

00:01:03.046 --> 00:01:06.070
Have drinking water tested in a laboratory.

00:01:06.883 --> 00:01:10.411
If something here is wrong, click Report this
station.

00:01:10.531 --> 00:01:13.411
A message opens, ready to finish.

00:01:14.217 --> 00:01:16.953
Privacy says who can see this station.

00:01:17.073 --> 00:01:20.385
To change it, click Ask to change privacy.

00:01:20.505 --> 00:01:22.785
A Super Admin decides.

00:01:23.617 --> 00:01:28.921
Station details shows the name, the kind of
station, and any note you wrote.

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:32.126
The station code is made for you.

00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:36.134
You cannot change it, so your printed labels
keep working.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:43.454
Station location shows the state, district,
village, and exact latitude and longitude.

00:01:43.574 --> 00:01:46.286
Only you see the country and postcode.

00:01:47.117 --> 00:01:49.181
Next, the photo.

00:01:49.301 --> 00:01:52.949
It helps the next visitor know they have found
the right well.

00:01:53.069 --> 00:01:55.421
A station keeps one photo.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.626
Click the photo to see it large.

00:01:58.746 --> 00:02:03.930
At the top right, Close returns to the page,
and Delete removes the photo.

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.438
Delete asks once, to be sure.

00:02:07.558 --> 00:02:12.094
We will say yes, to see what a station with no
photo looks like.

00:02:12.917 --> 00:02:15.533
Now the box says there is no photo.

00:02:15.653 --> 00:02:18.029
A new station looks like this.

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:21.466
Click Add photo and choose a picture.

00:02:21.586 --> 00:02:24.058
A small preview appears first.

00:02:24.178 --> 00:02:27.610
The cross removes it, and Cancel starts again.

00:02:28.417 --> 00:02:30.289
Press Upload.

00:02:30.409 --> 00:02:35.017
The picture is made smaller, so it sends fast
on a slow connection.

00:02:35.137 --> 00:02:37.825
Practice mode shows a sample picture.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:42.490
Once there is a photo, the button says Replace
photo.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:47.074
OurWater asks you to confirm, because the old
picture is lost.

00:02:47.883 --> 00:02:49.779
Now the QR code.

00:02:49.899 --> 00:02:53.067
It is a square pattern that a phone camera can
read.

00:02:53.187 --> 00:02:55.227
Click Show QR code.

00:02:56.050 --> 00:03:01.522
Anyone who scans this code with a phone opens
OurWater on the map, at this station.

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:05.230
Click Download QR to save the picture.

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:08.710
Print it, and stick it on or near the well.

00:03:09.517 --> 00:03:12.061
This page has no measurement list.

00:03:12.181 --> 00:03:17.125
Data history does, newest first, so the latest
one is at the top.

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:23.302
To keep a station close, open its pop-up on My
stations and click Add to favourites.

00:03:23.422 --> 00:03:25.726
The button then says Favourited.

00:03:26.550 --> 00:03:30.390
Back on the station page, click Edit to change
something.

00:03:31.217 --> 00:03:33.281
This is the edit form.

00:03:33.401 --> 00:03:37.673
It holds the same details as the page, ready
for you to change.

00:03:38.483 --> 00:03:40.859
Change the station's name here.

00:03:40.979 --> 00:03:43.955
Choose a name your neighbours will recognise.

00:03:44.783 --> 00:03:49.511
You can change the kind of station too, if you
chose the wrong one at the start.

00:03:50.317 --> 00:03:54.661
Remark is for any note about the station, such
as how to find it.

00:03:55.483 --> 00:03:58.147
The station code cannot be edited.

00:03:58.267 --> 00:04:01.507
OurWater made it, and it never changes.

00:04:02.317 --> 00:04:04.189
Below is the place.

00:04:04.309 --> 00:04:08.941
Fix the state, village, district or postcode
if they were wrong.

00:04:09.061 --> 00:04:12.301
Latitude and longitude can be corrected too.

00:04:13.117 --> 00:04:18.397
If you clear the name and press Save changes,
OurWater tells you that a name is needed.

00:04:19.217 --> 00:04:23.729
Type the name again, add to your note, and
press Save changes.

00:04:23.849 --> 00:04:26.297
You come back to the station page.

00:04:27.117 --> 00:04:32.085
Audit shows whether the station is active, who
owns it, and when it was made.

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:34.461
Updated shows your change.

00:04:35.283 --> 00:04:37.827
Last, delete a station.

00:04:37.947 --> 00:04:41.379
This practice station was made only for this
video.

00:04:41.499 --> 00:04:43.371
Click Delete.

00:04:44.183 --> 00:04:47.783
OurWater asks first: Delete this station?

00:04:47.903 --> 00:04:50.783
It will be switched off and hidden from the
map.

00:04:50.903 --> 00:04:52.775
Its measurements are kept.

00:04:53.583 --> 00:04:56.775
Confirm, and you are back on My stations.

00:04:56.895 --> 00:05:00.207
In your own account the station is switched
off.

00:05:00.327 --> 00:05:03.639
In practice mode, nothing real changes.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.634
That is your station page.

00:05:06.754 --> 00:05:09.418
Thanks for helping look after our water.
